column41:
Oh, nice, on Fedora 23 beta, I can simulate die rolls<p><pre><code>     shuf -r -z -n 100 -e 1 2 3 4 5 6;echo -e &quot;
&quot;
</code></pre>
And rolls of a non-transitive (Grime) die<p><pre><code>     shuf -r -z -n 100 -e 3 3 3 3 3 6;echo -e &quot;
&quot;
</code></pre>
Which is timely. I sometimes forget how flexible the terminal prompt is...
